# Changes Log — fix/handover-agent-remaining-gaps

Date: 2026-08-04
Branch: `fix/handover-agent-remaining-gaps` (from `fix/staging`)
Scope: Service Request Chatbot — Handover AI agent remaining functional gaps

## Summary

Closes agent-owned defects from UAT around lease revalidation, inspection
assignee single-select enforcement, document-delete lease hydration, and soft
FM cancel. Portal Formik sync, Handover Type, platform Reject / Ask-for-more /
CREATE Save-as-Draft remain out of scope (need MSP UI and/or product API contracts).

## Changes

### 1. Lease code revalidation after intentional change
- **Files:** `backend/app/agents/graph/nodes/shared/merge_state_node.py`,
  `backend/app/agents/graph/nodes/handover/confirmation_node.py`
- On explicit lease change (confirmation-card edit, `active_field=lease_code`,
  or change/switch phrasing), clear `lease_id` and derived enrichment so
  `lease_lookup` re-runs.
- Hallucinated lease_code overwrites after resolve remain blocked.
- CREATE confirmation card: `lease_code` is editable.

### 2. Inspection assignee single-select + invalid input rejection
- **Files:** `confirmation_node.py`, `merge_state_node.py`
- Confirmation card emits `options: [FM_MANAGER, OPERATIONS]` for
  `inspection_done_by` (chat FE already renders `<select>` when options present).
- Merge normalizes aliases (`ops` → `OPERATIONS`) and rejects invalid values
  (e.g. `mall manager`) and low-confidence enum guesses.

### 3. Document delete lease_id hydration
- **Files:** `backend/app/api/routes/upload.py`,
  `frontend/lib/api/upload-client.ts`,
  `frontend/components/chatbot/DocumentUploadPanel.tsx`
- DELETE `/upload` now resolves `lease_id` from draft (`lease_id` /
  `contract_id`) and, when missing, hydrates via GET SR (same path as upload).
- Hydrated refs are persisted on the draft for subsequent deletes.
- Chat FE passes `lease_id` / `contract_id` on delete when known.

### 4. FM Review soft cancel (no workflow reload wipe)
- **File:** `backend/app/agents/graph/nodes/handover/fm_review_entry_node.py`
- Cancel / cancel_update clears only pending confirmation + staged `fm_action`.
- Collected data, documents, `sr_id`, and stage are preserved.
- Reject remains an explicit stub until platform reject PATCH contract exists.

